 eat increase your serotonin  levels and reduce cravings cravings can  be worsened in types of stress in our  busy schedule it is very easy to pop a  pill and push through without giving our  body the chance to truly rest and relax  more than ever this is the time where  you should allow your mind and body to  relax pamper yourself do an activity you  enjoy or sometimes what we need is to do  absolutely nothing these are seven  simple tips which can help to reduce  period cravings on the flip side here  are three foods to limit first caffeine  too much of caffeine can cause  irritability stress nervousness which  can potentially lead to food cravings  and worsen menstrual cramps second salt  because it causes water retention and  bloating third alcohol because it can  act as depressant and worsen PMS  symptoms it is important to know that we  are all different and that the cravings  and symptoms may or may not apply to you  therefore during this special time of  the month it is very important to listen  to your body fill your body with good  food keep moving keep yourself hydrated  and rest when you need to your body  knows best so listen to it for new  fitness food and motivational videos  please like share and subscribe to my  youtube channel and website do you  follow me on Facebook Instagram and  Twitter to stay connected with me thanks  guys  [Music]  you

